# Respostas da API

## Envelope padrão

```csharp
public sealed record ApiResponse<T>(bool Success, T? Data, ApiError? Error)
{
    public static ApiResponse<T> Ok(T data) => new(true, data, null);
    public static ApiResponse<T> Fail(ApiError error) => new(false, default, error);
}

public sealed record ApiError(string Code, string Message, IReadOnlyList<FieldError>? Fields = null);
public sealed record FieldError(string Field, string Message);
```

## Sucesso (200/201)

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": { "id": "...", "name": "Product A" },
  "error": null
}
```

## Erro de validação (400)

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "data": null,
  "error": {
    "code": "VALIDATION_ERROR",
    "message": "Validation failed.",
    "fields": [{ "field": "name", "message": "Name is required." }]
  }
}
```

## Erro de negócio (422)

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "data": null,
  "error": { "code": "BUSINESS_ERROR", "message": "Insufficient stock." }
}
```

## Paginação

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "items": [...],
    "page": 1,
    "pageSize": 20,
    "totalCount": 150
  },
  "error": null
}
```

Middleware global mapeia exceções (`11-exceptions.mdc`) para este formato.
